# ==============================================================================
# .gitignore for Academic Machine Learning & Prognostics Research Project
# Project: Explainable Dual-Head CNN-BiLSTM-Attention Bearing Prognostics
# Dataset Benchmark: PRONOSTIA / IEEE PHM 2012 Bearing Run-to-Failure
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. RAW DATASETS & LARGE BENCHMARK ARCHIVES
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Complete PRONOSTIA / IEEE PHM 2012 raw dataset directory (~3+ GB, 17,355 files)
ieee-phm-2012-data-challenge-dataset-master/
ieee-phm-2012-data-challenge-dataset-master/**
*ieee-phm-2012*
*ieee_phm_2012*
*pronostia*
*PRONOSTIA*

# General raw data directories
data/
dataset/
datasets/
raw_data/
raw-data/

