# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 12. EXPLICIT REPRODUCIBILITY GUARANTEES (ACADEMIC ARTIFACTS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ensure core research code, notebooks, and documentation are never omitted
!*.py
!*.js
!*.ipynb
!*.md

# Ensure paper package, figures, and rendered assets are tracked
!paper/
!paper/**

# Ensure empirical metrics, evaluation CSVs, and visualization figures are tracked
!results/
!results/**

# Ensure frozen trained model weights, feature metadata, and scalers are tracked
!models/
!models/**
